/* 确认订单页 · 两段式：上=信息显示（地址/收货人/电话/送达时间），下=优惠券+商品，底=支付 */
.confirm-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding-bottom: 200rpx;
  background: #FAFAFA;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.confirm-page .card {
  margin: 0 32rpx 20rpx;
}

/* ===== 上部分：信息显示 ===== */
.info-card {
  padding: 8rpx 32rpx;
}

/* 第一行：地址 + 详细地址（加大显示） */
.addr-main {
  padding: 24rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.addr-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.addr-main-text {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #111111;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.addr-placeholder {
  color: #999999;
  font-weight: 400;
}

/* 第二/三行：收货人 / 联系电话（小字） */
.info-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.info-label {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #666666;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
}

.info-input {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #111111;
  text-align: right;
}

/* 第四行：预计送达时间（左右两部分） */
.time-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 0 8rpx;
}

.time-mode {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #111111;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.time-val {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #111111;
  text-align: right;
}

.time-val.blue {
  color: #3078C0;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ===== 下部分：优惠券 + 商品信息 ===== */
.goods-card .cell {
  margin-bottom: 4rpx;
}

.shop-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 0 16rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.shop-badge {
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #DCE9F8;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.shop-name {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #111111;
}

.o-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 16rpx 0;
}

.o-img {
  width: 96rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F5F5F5;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.o-info {
  flex: 1;
  margin: 0 20rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.o-name {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #111111;
}

.o-price {
  text-align: right;
}

.o-price-now {
  color: var(--brand);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.o-price-old {
  color: #999999;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  text-decoration: line-through;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.fee-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 0;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.fee-label {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #111111;
}

.fee-val {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #3078C0;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.discount-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 16rpx 0;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.discount-label {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #111111;
}

.discount-val {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #999999;
  margin-right: 8rpx;
}

.discount-total {
  margin-left: auto;
  color: var(--brand);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-right: 8rpx;
}

.remark-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20rpx 0 0;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}

.remark-label {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #111111;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-right: 24rpx;
}

.remark-input {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #111111;
  text-align: right;
}

.disclaimer-link {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6rpx;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #999999;
  padding: 8rpx 0 24rpx;
}

/* ===== 底部支付栏 ===== */
.pay-icon {
  width: 84rpx;
  height: 84rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #DCE9F8;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.pay-total {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.pay-price {
  color: var(--brand);
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* ===== 弹层 ===== */
.picker-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}

.picker-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.picker-item {
  padding: 26rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F5F5F5;
  border: 2rpx solid transparent;
}

.picker-item.active {
  background: #DCE9F8;
  border-color: #3078C0;
}

.picker-name {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #111111;
}

.picker-sub {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.addr-pick-line1 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.addr-pick-phone {
  margin-left: 4rpx;
}

.picker-empty {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40rpx 0;
}

.addr-add-btn {
  margin-top: 32rpx;
  background: #3078C0;
  color: #ffffff;
}

/* ===== 时间选择弹层：尽快送达（默认）+ 指定时间档 ===== */
.tsheet {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.tsheet-opt {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 26rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F5F5F5;
  border: 2rpx solid transparent;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #111111;
}

.tsheet-opt.on {
  background: #DCE9F8;
  border-color: #3078C0;
  color: #3078C0;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.tsheet-sub {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #999999;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.tsheet-opt.on .tsheet-sub {
  color: #3078C0;
}
